OL,3,GNEWSA'That shock, it lives with me' -
OL,4,AWomen speak out after spate of masked
OL,5,Arobberies
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the moment she was attacked, Eve
OL,8,Fsaid her life changed: "When he robbed
OL,9,Fme, he took a lot more than my gold
OL,10,Fchains off me. He took the person that
OL,11,FI was."
OL,13,FThe 78-year-old grandmother was getting
OL,14,Fin her car one evening in April when a
OL,15,Fmasked man grabbed her arm, stole her
OL,16,Fbracelets and ran off.
OL,18,F"That shock, it lives with me, that
OL,19,Fimage," she admitted, adding the
OL,20,Frobbery had a massive effect on her.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
