OL,3,GNEWSA'That shock, it lives with me' -
OL,4,AWomen speak out after spate of masked
OL,5,Arobberies
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's got worse as the days have gone
OL,8,Fby. I have to make sure the windows are
OL,9,Fshut in case anyone gets in while I'm
OL,10,Fin the room, and I'm frightened to
OL,11,Fanswer the door to anyone.
